{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Backrooms: Reset</strong> is a first-person survival horror exploration game.<br>Step into the Backrooms \u2014 a labyrinth of shifting halls and eerie, liminal environments. In this roguelike survival experience, the layout of the Backrooms remains constant, but each playthrough presents new challenges. You'll spawn in different locations each time, with every item and encounter dynamically altered. Clues are scarce, and exploration is key. Death resets your progress back to the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On October 3rd, 1996, a VHS tape was discovered in the back room of a shuttered video rental store in rural Ohio. The contents appeared to document the final known movements of a [REDACTED] who vanished without a trace. What you are about to witness is the unaltered footage recovered from that tape. Authorities never identified the subject. No missing persons case was ever filed. The individual was never found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Large, maze-like levels inspired by the Backrooms Wiki</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Entities from Backrooms lore, including Death Moths, Partygoers, Smilers, Wretches, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randomized item spawns to help you survive \u2014 including Almond Water and energy drinks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This game is an original interpretation of the Backrooms concept and is not affiliated with or endorsed by any other media or creators.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3765730?t=1751307870","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765730/43e5d7d6e69d56204908402495c04ffa6a18ae6e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751307870","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765730/1fcec2863926e131e1b6bab0c409395932ca3e3d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751307870","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765730/1fcec2863926e131e1b6bab0c409395932ca3e3d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751307870","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Backrooms: Reset</strong> is a first-person survival horror exploration game.<br>Step into the Backrooms \u2014 a labyrinth of shifting halls and eerie, liminal environments. In this roguelike survival experience, the layout of the Backrooms remains constant, but each playthrough presents new challenges. You'll spawn in different locations each time, with every item and encounter dynamically altered. Clues are scarce, and exploration is key. Death resets your progress back to the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On October 3rd, 1996, a VHS tape was discovered in the back room of a shuttered video rental store in rural Ohio. The contents appeared to document the final known movements of a [REDACTED] who vanished without a trace. What you are about to witness is the unaltered footage recovered from that tape. Authorities never identified the subject. No missing persons case was ever filed. The individual was never found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Large, maze-like levels inspired by the Backrooms Wiki</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Entities from Backrooms lore, including Death Moths, Partygoers, Smilers, Wretches, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randomized item spawns to help you survive \u2014 including Almond Water and energy drinks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This game is an original interpretation of the Backrooms concept and is not affiliated with or endorsed by any other media or creators.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Permafried Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765730/1fe752e916dbb2f3cafe15e238266177ee756e09/header.jpg?t=1751307870","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":false,"id":257159873,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257159873/movie480.mp4?t=1751307866","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257159873/movie_max.mp4?t=1751307866"},"name":"The Backrooms: Reset Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257159873/df1d127fdb3c7462044aff77aa46e6fda6c278a5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751307866","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257159873/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1751307866","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257159873/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1751307866"}}],"name":"The Backrooms: Reset","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core 2.0GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memo